Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.26,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Dez pras seis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.01,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Estou de rastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:06.58,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou preparar o jantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.86,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Como hoje a Clara tem treino
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:10.83,Vlog,,0,0,0,,na ginástica e chega um bocadinho tarde,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:13.75,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Espera, por favor, espera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:14.52,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou ser honesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.44,Vlog,,0,0,0,,eu ia fazer jantar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.80,Vlog,,0,0,0,,mas já não vou, porque, não dá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.96,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou fazer uns ovos e vou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:18.85,Vlog,,0,0,0,,servir a sopa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:20.33,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Eu descobri a melhor sopa de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.46,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sempre no Continente,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.50,Vlog,,0,0,0,,a receita do chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.54,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sopa de abóbora,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.52,Vlog,,0,0,0,,camarão e coentros, é maravilhosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:26.11,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Amamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.33,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá tomar banhoca,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:32.55,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não é doce,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.50,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não pode ser sempre doce, filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:41.37,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Posso ficar com mais sopa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:41.92,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Podes, podes.
